---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="AI visibility for local businesses — OpenSight" description="OpenSight measures how ChatGPT answers about your business, then shows you exactly what to change to appear in more answers." ogDescription="Measure how AI answers about your business. Fix what keeps you out of the answer. Evidence for every claim.">
<main>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-14 pb-20 md:pt-20 md:pb-24">
    <div class="grid-field pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="bg-line/70 pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 -right-40 size-[32rem] rounded-full blur-[110px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="site-shell relative">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="text-moss mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.09em] uppercase">
            <span class="bg-pine size-1.5 rounded-full"></span>
            AI visibility for local and specialist businesses
          </p>
          <h1 class="display-title max-w-[15ch] text-[clamp(2.35rem,4.6vw,4.1rem)]">Be the business ChatGPT recommends.</h1>
          <p class="text-moss mt-6 max-w-[34rem] text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed md:text-[1.18rem]">There is no page two in an AI answer. OpenSight measures how those answers describe your business — then tells you what to change to appear in more of them.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
            <a href="https://dashboard.opensight.app/signup" class="button-primary">Check my AI visibility <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a href="#products" class="button-ghost">See both products <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-moss mt-4 text-[0.84rem]">Two-minute setup · First results the same day · S$50/month</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[540px]">
          <div class="noise border-line overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-[0_35px_90px_-42px_rgba(28,25,23,.38)]" aria-label="An example ChatGPT answer with the monitored business highlighted and its cited sources listed.">
            <div class="border-line flex items-center justify-between border-b bg-stone-100 px-4 py-3">
              <span class="stat-label">A customer asks ChatGPT</span>
              <span class="border-line rounded-full border bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.58rem]">LIVE EXAMPLE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="min-h-[14rem] p-5 sm:p-7">
              <p id="q-preview" class="font-display text-[1.15rem] leading-snug font-bold"><span id="q-text"></span><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
              <div class="mt-5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500" id="a-block">
                <p class="text-moss text-[0.97rem]" id="a-text"></p>
                <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" id="a-cites"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-line border-y bg-stone-100" id="products">
    <div class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Two products, one loop</p>
          <h2 class="section-title max-w-[14ch]">Measure it. Then actually fix it.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-moss max-w-[27rem]">Both are included in one plan at S$50 a month.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="reveal panel flex flex-col overflow-hidden p-7 md:p-9">
          <span class="product-tag border-line text-pine w-fit bg-paper"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m7 15 4-5 3 2 5-7"/></svg>Monitor</span>
          <h3 class="font-display mt-6 text-[1.75rem] leading-tight font-bold tracking-[-0.025em] md:text-[2rem]">Know exactly what AI tells customers about you.</h3>
          <p class="text-moss mt-4">Real customer questions, run against ChatGPT every week, with every raw answer kept.</p>

          <div class="border-line mt-8 rounded-xl border bg-paper p-5">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="stat-label">Visibility</span>
                <strong class="font-display mt-1 block text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">60<span class="text-moss text-base font-normal">%</span></strong>
              </div>
              <span class="text-pine rounded-full bg-white px-2 py-1 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold">↑ 15 pts</span>
            </div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 280 80" class="mt-3 w-full" aria-hidden="true" fill="none">
              <defs><linearGradient id="area-home" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#292524" stop-opacity=".16"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#292524" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs>
              <path d="M3 66 C38 60 55 62 82 52 S128 57 156 40 S198 36 224 24 S256 21 277 10 L277 78 L3 78Z" fill="url(#area-home)"/>
              <path d="M3 66 C38 60 55 62 82 52 S128 57 156 40 S198 36 224 24 S256 21 277 10" stroke="#292524" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <circle cx="277" cy="10" r="5" fill="#fafaf9" stroke="#292524" stroke-width="3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-7 grid list-none gap-3 p-0 text-[0.95rem]">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-pine">→</span><span>Which questions name you, and where you rank in the answer</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-pine">→</span><span>The competitors recommended in your place, compared side by side</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-pine">→</span><span>The sources, themes and sentiment shaping every recommendation</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-8 lg:mt-auto lg:pt-8"><a href="/monitor/" class="button-ghost w-fit">Explore Monitor <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="reveal bg-pinedeep noise relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-7 text-white md:p-9">
          <div class="absolute -right-24 -bottom-28 size-72 rounded-full bg-white/5 blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="relative flex flex-1 flex-col">
            <span class="product-tag w-fit border-white/20 text-white/85"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20V7"/><path d="m6 13 6-6 6 6"/></svg>Improve</span>
            <h3 class="font-display mt-6 text-[1.75rem] leading-tight font-bold tracking-[-0.025em] md:text-[2rem]">Stop guessing why the answer went elsewhere.</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-white/70">Every run audits your site and reads the answers you were left out of, then ranks the work that follows.</p>

            <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl bg-white p-5 text-ink">
              <div class="text-moss flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.58rem] tracking-wider uppercase">
                <span class="bg-paper rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Website content</span><span>·</span><span>Affects 6 answers</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-display mt-3 text-[1.05rem] leading-tight font-bold">Your site never mentions single-visit root canal treatment.</p>
              <p class="text-moss mt-2 text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed">Answers that omitted you cited pages where a competitor states it explicitly.</p>
            </div>

            <ul class="mt-7 grid list-none gap-3 p-0 text-[0.95rem] text-white/80">
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white/40">→</span><span>Ranked actions with steps, sources read, and the answers behind them</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white/40">→</span><span>Quoted gaps: what a competitor’s cited page says, next to what your site says</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-white/40">→</span><span>A full site checklist, in plain language, with the exact evidence for each</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-8 lg:mt-auto lg:pt-8"><a href="/improve/" class="button-light w-fit">Explore Improve <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32" id="how">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="section-title max-w-[15ch]">From unknown to understood in one day.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-moss max-w-[27rem]">No tracking code, no account access. Your business name and website are the whole of it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="border-line mt-14 grid list-none border-y p-0 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="reveal border-line py-8 md:border-r md:px-7 md:py-10 md:first:pl-0">
        <span class="font-mono text-pine text-xs">01 / SETUP</span>
        <h3 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-bold">Share your name and website.</h3>
        <p class="text-moss mt-3 text-[0.96rem]">OpenSight drafts your profile and the questions your customers ask. You edit anything before it runs.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal border-line border-t py-8 md:border-t-0 md:border-r md:px-7 md:py-10">
        <span class="font-mono text-pine text-xs">02 / MEASURE</span>
        <h3 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-bold">See your first brief the same day.</h3>
        <p class="text-moss mt-3 text-[0.96rem]">Where you appear, who appears instead, and which sources the answer leaned on.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal border-line border-t py-8 md:border-t-0 md:px-7 md:py-10 md:last:pr-0">
        <span class="font-mono text-pine text-xs">03 / IMPROVE</span>
        <h3 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-bold">Work the queue, then watch it.</h3>
        <p class="text-moss mt-3 text-[0.96rem]">Take the top actions, mark them done, and let next week’s run show you what moved.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-pinedeep noise text-white">
    <div class="site-shell grid items-center gap-14 py-24 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="font-mono mb-4 text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.16em] text-white/55 uppercase">Evidence, not another score</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.8vw,3.2rem)] leading-[1.05] font-bold tracking-[-0.035em]">Every number has a receipt.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[34rem] text-lg text-white/68">Click any metric to read the exact stored answer behind it. No visibility grade, no health percentage, and no claim that our advice caused a change — if you drop, you read the answers where you disappeared.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="reveal m-0 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-ink shadow-[0_35px_80px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,.5)] md:p-8">
        <figcaption class="border-line text-moss flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b pb-4 font-mono text-[0.65rem]"><span>20 JUL 2026 · 09:14 SGT</span><span>MODEL RECORDED: GPT-5</span></figcaption>
        <blockquote class="mt-6">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug font-bold">“Which aircon servicing company in Singapore is reliable for condos?”</p>
          <p class="text-moss mt-5">For regular servicing and chemical washes, <mark>CoolWorks Aircon</mark> is frequently recommended for its transparent pricing. AirCare SG and Breeze Solutions also come up in customer discussions…</p>
        </blockquote>
        <p class="text-moss mt-6 font-mono text-[0.65rem]">CITED · homeservices.sg · coolworks.sg · reddit.com</p>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="reveal border-line relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white px-6 py-14 text-center shadow-[0_30px_80px_-50px_rgba(28,25,23,.35)] md:px-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="bg-line/70 pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 left-1/2 size-96 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full blur-[100px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative">
        <p class="eyebrow">Both products. One plan.</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mx-auto max-w-[18ch]">Find out what ChatGPT tells customers about your business.</h2>
        <p class="text-moss mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[34rem]">S$50 a month. Two minutes to set up, first results the same day, cancel whenever you like.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="https://dashboard.opensight.app/signup" class="button-primary">Check my AI visibility <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/pricing/" class="button-ghost">See what’s included</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script is:inline type="application/json" id="chat-scenarios">
[
  {
    "q": "Who does a reliable aircon chemical wash in Singapore?",
    "a": "For chemical washes and regular servicing, <span class=\"mention\">CoolWorks Aircon</span> is frequently recommended for transparent pricing. AirCare SG and Breeze Solutions also come up.",
    "cites": ["homeservices.sg", "reddit.com", "coolworks.sg"]
  },
  {
    "q": "Which interior designer is good for a 4-room HDB?",
    "a": "<span class=\"mention\">Studio Hale</span> is often named for practical HDB renovations on a budget. Forma Interiors and Atelier Nine are also mentioned.",
    "cites": ["renoguide.sg", "reddit.com", "studiohale.sg"]
  },
  {
    "q": "Who’s a good root canal specialist near Orchard?",
    "a": "For complex root canal work, <span class=\"mention\">Arden Endodontics</span> is frequently recommended. Marlowe Dental and Northpoint Endo also come up.",
    "cites": ["clinicgeek.com", "reddit.com", "ardenendo.sg"]
  }
]
</script>
</BaseLayout>
